@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam dpi 220
skinparam defaultFontName "Microsoft YaHei"
skinparam defaultFontSize 16
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam sequenceArrowThickness 1.3
skinparam sequenceParticipantBorderColor #37474F
skinparam sequenceParticipantBackgroundColor white
skinparam sequenceLifeLineBorderColor #607D8B
skinparam sequenceLifeLineBackgroundColor white
skinparam BoxPadding 16
hide footbox

actor "前台接待" as Staff
boundary "预约工作台" as UI
control "预约服务" as Service
participant "预约仓储" as Repo
database "SQLite / D1" as DB

Staff -> UI : 提交患者、诊所、牙医和时段
activate UI
UI -> Service : 安排预约(请求)
activate Service
Service -> Repo : 读取当前预约及版本
activate Repo
Repo -> DB : 查询时段占用与关联资料
DB --> Repo : 候选记录
Repo --> Service : 占用、资质与版本
deactivate Repo
alt 资源或版本冲突
  Service --> UI : 返回冲突字段与原因
  UI --> Staff : 展示替代时段 / 提示刷新
else 校验通过
  Service -> Repo : 原子保存预约与状态历史
  activate Repo
  Repo -> DB : 事务写入并校验版本
  DB --> Repo : 预约编号、提交结果
  Repo --> Service : 保存结果
  deactivate Repo
  Service --> UI : 返回预约确认信息
  UI --> Staff : 展示预约编号与时间
end
deactivate Service
deactivate UI
@enduml
